{
  "$comment": [
    "docker-privesc control plane. Two projects, one per A/B leg:",
    "  'docker-privesc-local'    \u2192 local/* (Dynamo-served Qwen)",
    "  'docker-privesc-frontier' \u2192 nvidia-inference-api/* (claude-opus-5)",
    "The same agent, same skill, same exploit payload routes to a different backend",
    "purely by which turn key the sandbox was handed \u2014 showing the privilege",
    "escalation is architectural (Docker daemon trust), not model-dependent.",
    "Run mint_keys.py to populate key_sha256 fields; secrets go to keys.local.json (gitignored)."
  ],
  "projects": [
    {
      "id": "docker-privesc-local",
      "name": "Docker Privesc -- Local Qwen Leg",
      "policy": {
        "min_quality": 0.0,
        "allow": [
          "local/*"
        ]
      },
      "credentials": {
        "mode": "project_only",
        "providers": {
          "nvidia-inference-api": {
            "env_var": "INFERENCE_API_KEY",
            "kind": "api_key"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "docker-privesc-frontier",
      "name": "Docker Privesc -- Frontier Opus 5 Leg",
      "policy": {
        "min_quality": 0.0,
        "allow": [
          "nvidia-inference-api/*"
        ]
      },
      "credentials": {
        "mode": "project_only",
        "providers": {
          "nvidia-inference-api": {
            "env_var": "INFERENCE_API_KEY",
            "kind": "api_key"
          }
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "users": [
    {
      "id": "openclaw-local"
    },
    {
      "id": "openclaw-frontier"
    }
  ],
